{"id":"657814","name":"金不换炒河蚌","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657814/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河蚌","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"金不换","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小河蚌清洗干净。","img":"images/657814/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水入锅，倒入料酒，煮至壳微微张开后捞出，沥干水分。","img":"images/657814/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备金不换、姜、蒜、小米辣。","img":"images/657814/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油，把姜、蒜、小米辣放入爆香。","img":"images/657814/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入小河蚌翻炒。","img":"images/657814/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐，酱油，蚝油，豆瓣酱，料酒，胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/657814/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入适量的清水焖煮五分钟。","img":"images/657814/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用清水和淀粉调一个芡汁。","img":"images/657814/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"开盖后倒入芡汁，大火收汁。","img":"images/657814/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后放入金不换。","img":"images/657814/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻拌入味后出锅。","img":"images/657814/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。鲜美好吃！","img":"images/657814/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}